      "general": {
        "abstract": "The VCG platform is an area of molassic foothills, covering the Louge, Touch and Save watersheds; it is bounded to the south, east and north by the Garonne. The platform is located inside the Zone Atelier Pyrénées-Garonne, and it includes the Auradé watershed site.\r\n",
